    "en": "Kibo UI is a curated component registry specifically designed for AI-native interfaces, LLM interactions, and agentic workflows. Built by Hayden Bleasel, it features streaming text renderers, branchable chat threads, prompt composers, tool call inspectors, and canvas node editors compatible with the shadcn CLI.",
